Package: proteoforge
Title: Reproducible, Publication-Grade LFQ Proteomics and Phosphoproteomics Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("ProteoForge", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "proteoforge@example.com"))
Description: A label-free quantitative (LFQ) proteomics and phosphoproteomics
    analysis platform supporting DIA-NN, Spectronaut, FragPipe, MaxQuant,
    Proteome Discoverer, and Skyline inputs. Provides a complete analysis
    pipeline from raw quantification to differential abundance testing,
    functional enrichment, network analysis, and publication-ready reports.
    Includes a production-grade Shiny application for interactive analysis.
